The insert failed because NPSP requires `npsp__Day_of_Month__c` to be populated when the installment period is Monthly. Leaving it empty for day 31 triggers that validation. NPSP's own last-day convention stores the picklist value `Last_Day` in the day field. I now set `npsp__Day_of_Month__c = 'Last_Day'` for 31. I also keep `npsp__Always_Use_Last_Day_Of_Month__c = true`, so both representations of the last-day option are present.

I also removed the payment-method whitelist check. It wasn't a stated requirement, and it could reject values the org's picklist accepts. Null and negative installments remain handled.

